## Billing Integration

The existing billing system in `billing.html` handles credit deduction:
- When a lead is inserted into the database
- The subscription listener in `billing.html` detects it
- Credits are automatically deducted
- Transaction is recorded in `billing_transactions`

No changes needed to billing logic!
